    "text": "mainstreetmediatn.com\nwebsite\nDickson County, Tennessee\nLeadership Dickson County applications now being accepted\nBy STAFF REPORT,\n13 hours agoAre you ready to grow, connect, and lead? Applications for the Leadership Dickson County Class of 2026 are now being accepted through August 1. Whether you’re looking to expand your professional network or make a deeper impact in our community, this program is your opportunity to do just that. If you haven’t been through the program yet, now is your time to join this dynamic group of leaders.",
